  "glassOrbs": {
    "$description": "The canvas orbs painted by GlassOrbControl with the orbGradient above: the recording orb and the onboarding's welcome and voice orbs. 'size' is the control's side in px, 'body' the sphere's diameter as a share of it, 'glowBlur' the blur of the white inner glow (CSS box-shadow: inset 0 0 Npx), 'haloBlur' the standard deviation of the halo's Gaussian blur (CSS blur(Npx)), 'haloOpacity' its opacity, 'glow' the opacity of the inner glow. haloBlur, haloOpacity and glow differ between the themes: each has a 'Dark' twin that is required (the generator refuses an entry without it); size, body and glowBlur are the same in both.",
